diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index cea1096..198d920 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,10 +8,18 @@ adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
 ### Added
 
+- The locked library has its own Trash (menu in the locked library): books you delete there can now be restored.
+- After restoring a backup that contains locked books, Pagemark reminds you that the PIN is not part of backups and to set a new one.
+
 ### Changed
 
+- Book search ranks the real book first and moves study guides, summaries and workbooks behind "Show more results".
+- Pagemark no longer requests storage, media or notification permissions it never used.
+
 ### Fixed
 
+- Deleted locked books were stuck invisible in Trash and silently purged after 30 days.
+
 ## [0.4.1] - 2026-10-12
 
 ### Fixed
